[4022]={["atomIDs"]={"4022:description:1-54","4022:description:59-76","4022:description:78-96","4022:objective:1-88"},["opening"]="Cyrus demanded the molt gained through Kalaran's work. The object was to stand as evidence of usefulness before the dragon would proceed.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to show Cyrus the molt.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the molt to Cyrus.",["sourceHash"]="8d8b0089e44e88786d1435f3719854b609c2123683bec1c2b2e9fffcb097a2d0",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4023]={["aftermath"]="Cyrus examined a molt and acknowledged a measure of usefulness.",["atomIDs"]={"4023:description:1-24","4023:description:26-67","4023:objective:1-44","4023:objective:49-114"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4023:completion:1-26","4023:completion:31-88"},["opening"]="Cyrus required evidence before granting further attention. This approach demanded proof of worth without naming a new deed to perform.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to present proof to Cyrus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} satisfied Cyrus's demand for evidence.",["sourceHash"]="b6fb9caf3df580320e0d3bbae7a07476fafee82cfdaecb614d09584ec3cdcd0f",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4024]={["aftermath"]="Cyrus seized the essence eagerly, then dismissed the messenger with the promised prize.",["atomIDs"]={"4024:description:1-59","4024:description:61-121","4024:description:123-174","4024:description:179-276","4024:description:278-362","4024:description:367-428","4024:description:433-456","4024:objective:1-45","4024:objective:50-110","4024:objective:112-214","4024:objective:219-273"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4024:completion:1-51","4024:completion:56-59","4024:completion:64-91","4024:completion:93-115"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Bael'Gar and capture his inner flame in the altered dragon molt.",["opening"]="Cyrus craved Blackrock's inner heat and named Bael'Gar, a being born of Ragnaros's fires, as its source. Altered black dragon molt would contain the essence extracted from the giant's smoldering remains.",["pending"]="{actor} would face Bael'Gar and encase a fragment of his inner fire.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the encased fiery essence to Cyrus.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="7fc1d9cc9699ac7bfdcd73238055e3b9f63730e6d74aac12a01995919216c097",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4061]={["aftermath"]="Her close examination exposed initials etched into each fragment's structure.",["atomIDs"]={"4061:description:1-90","4061:description:92-210","4061:description:212-244","4061:description:249-395","4061:description:397-499","4061:objective:1-108","4061:objective:113-219"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4061:completion:1-45","4061:completion:50-118","4061:completion:123-134","4061:completion:136-206","4061:completion:208-216"},["opening"]="Theodora traced machines encountered in the Gorge to imports from the Steppes, possibly the Depths. Shards from regional creations might establish their origin.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover ten elemental shards.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the fragments to Theodora.",["sourceHash"]="e220327f3804bc922c0007859eb476e68548f28aff5f9ec6fe83daabd099032b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4062]={["aftermath"]="Lotwil recognized the markings and reacted with alarm.",["atomIDs"]={"4062:description:11-69","4062:description:71-121","4062:description:123-230","4062:description:235-300","4062:description:302-367","4062:description:369-410","4062:objective:1-51","4062:objective:56-130"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4062:completion:1-28","4062:completion:38-59"},["opening"]="Markings on the shards suggested a fourth rank of created beings. Theodora considered it a low rank but needed Lotwil's elemental expertise to interpret the sample.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry the shard to Lotwil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the sample to the scholar.",["sourceHash"]="8062c6eb5185abbd330ee8399a5e168d7751b6f7f7caeddd352bf75cc6a6d355",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4063]={["aftermath"]="The head was a Dark Iron machine rather than flesh. Lotwil concluded that the figure was another creation and feared a replacement could rise after it.",["atomIDs"]={"4063:description:1-24","4063:description:26-60","4063:description:62-79","4063:description:81-109","4063:description:114-206","4063:description:208-268","4063:description:273-331","4063:description:333-378","4063:description:380-440","4063:description:442-491","4063:objective:1-35","4063:objective:37-62","4063:objective:64-193","4063:objective:195-232"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4063:completion:1-15","4063:completion:17-39","4063:completion:41-121","4063:completion:123-234"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Argelmach and bring his head and ten intact elemental cores to Lotwil.",["opening"]="Lotwil thought he had killed Argelmach ten years earlier, after the dwarf twisted his research toward cruel ends. New machines suggested the old work had returned; samples and a head would help determine what now stood behind it.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Argelmach and collect cores from his protecting constructs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Argelmach's head and the elemental cores to Lotwil.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="6451270ea6303df5adc4c4d1a7635a784e28382ebebcc9ea109891a5109907f2",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4081]={["aftermath"]="Goretooth treated the attack as the opening strike and directed attention to further orders.",["atomIDs"]={"4081:description:1-76","4081:description:81-167","4081:description:172-299","4081:description:301-376","4081:description:381-494","4081:objective:1-60","4081:objective:65-169","4081:objective:171-211"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4081:completion:1-60","4081:completion:62-85","4081:completion:87-145","4081:completion:150-186"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat the specified Anvilrage guards, wardens and footmen for Goretooth.",["opening"]="Goretooth's first strike against Angerforge's forces was driven by the destruction of the expedition's 109th division. The order targeted the general's front line inside Blackrock Depths, making vengeance part of an organized military campaign.",["pending"]="{actor} would strike the Anvilrage front line in the Depths.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Goretooth's charge against the Anvilrage troops.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="cbaa4ffbab226c28e3f7c3e0bfe48761e9c1133139ba44582f7c9cac1f94d95d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4082]={["aftermath"]="Goretooth anticipated Angerforge's anger and pointed toward a later operation against the general himself.",["atomIDs"]={"4082:description:1-76","4082:description:81-98","4082:description:100-223","4082:description:225-318","4082:description:320-363","4082:description:368-419","4082:objective:1-60","4082:objective:65-169","4082:objective:171-211"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4082:completion:1-28","4082:completion:30-35","4082:completion:37-139","4082:completion:141-235"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat ten Anvilrage medics, ten soldiers and ten officers for Goretooth.",["opening"]="Lexlort's reconnaissance had located senior Dark Iron forces training behind a locked gate near the city's heart. Goretooth wanted this inner force struck after the earlier attack on Angerforge's men.",["pending"]="{actor} would attack the Anvilrage training forces deeper in the city.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the charge against the medics, soldiers and officers.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="d41a84b88fc7b5b8e4a51b23f7317bb27a11978e58f739c8b3e9710f40086951",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4084]={["atomIDs"]={"4084:description:1-39","4084:description:44-135","4084:description:140-201","4084:description:203-265","4084:description:267-310","4084:description:315-321","4084:description:323-362","4084:description:364-397","4084:description:402-420","4084:description:422-510","4084:objective:1-77"},["bridge"]="The lead had reached Eridan, who did not know Linken but recognized the power he sought. Eleven Silvery Claws and an Irontree Heart were the first requirements for answering Blazerunner's aura.",["bridgeFrom"]=3942,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Eridan did not know Linken, but recognized the purpose that could have sent him there. Blazerunner's aura required a special power; eleven silvery claws and an Irontree Heart were its first materials.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect eleven Silvery Claws and an Irontree Heart for Eridan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered eleven Silvery Claws and an Irontree Heart to Eridan Bluewind.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="63e9a262c48206c158ff48d5e3991161390d9e87a306e1a4e6c3de69f288120a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4101]={["aftermath"]="She accepted the service as proof of commitment and offered to turn attention toward salves and preservation.",["atomIDs"]={"4101:description:1-74","4101:description:77-173","4101:description:176-244","4101:description:249-286","4101:description:289-359","4101:description:362-488","4101:objective:1-57"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4101:completion:1-93","4101:completion:95-182","4101:completion:184-207","4101:completion:212-359","4101:completion:361-442","4101:completion:447-487"},["opening"]="Arathandris withheld cleansing knowledge until trust was earned. Sap from Warpwood creatures she judged beyond recovery could support study aimed at saving other life.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather fifteen pieces of blood amber.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the amber to Arathandris.",["sourceHash"]="ad7770d3a0ee05d07ef76a2465766407fa005bafaf6074ff3b217eb8a026efce",["sourceRaceMask"]="1101",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4102]={["aftermath"]="Maybess acknowledged trust and proposed work with her cleansing salves.",["atomIDs"]={"4102:description:1-74","4102:description:77-173","4102:description:176-244","4102:description:249-286","4102:description:289-359","4102:description:362-488","4102:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4102:completion:1-93","4102:completion:96-183","4102:completion:186-209","4102:completion:214-361","4102:completion:364-445","4102:completion:450-490"},["opening"]="Maybess saw corrupted plants as part of Felwood's wider injury. She required amber from the northern elementals before trusting an outsider with the knowledge to cleanse what could still be saved.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Maybess fifteen blood amber.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied her with the sap.",["sourceHash"]="4c05972e77864970d0833ec9c0faab73e1b67bcab78a375ef01f9f317d4e3803",["sourceRaceMask"]="690",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4103]={["atomIDs"]={"4103:requestItems:1-133","4103:requestItems:135-214","4103:requestItems:216-287","4103:requestItems:292-388"},["coverageQualification"]="BASIC_PROGRESS_EXCHANGE_CONTEXT",["minimumStage"]=3,["objectiveSummary"]="Trade corrupted soul shards for Cenarion plant salve.",["opening"]="A Cenarion beacon revealed corrupted soul shards in tainted beasts. Ground into a reagent, the shards could help make salve for restoring corrupted plants; prepared salve was offered in exchange.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather corrupted soul shards with the beacon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} exchanged corrupted soul shards for Cenarion plant salve.",["reviewStatus"]="RETAINED_PROGRESS_SOURCE_MARKERS_REVIEWED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="405f75c5cd1b41d583ef11795a263ce059d82bce046115b5c7b7cf934f88ae7d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentPlayability","unrecordedPersonalOutcome"}},
