[4120]={["atomIDs"]={"4120:description:1-72","4120:description:74-159","4120:description:164-268","4120:description:270-380","4120:description:393-432","4120:description:434-493","4120:objective:1-117"},["opening"]="Talo believed fel corruption had made Felwood's bears and wolves stronger as well as mad. A hunter seeking to understand an enemy's strengths could test that belief against the grizzlies and ravagers there.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront twelve Angerclaw Grizzlies and twelve Felpaw Ravagers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Talo's assignment against twelve Angerclaw Grizzlies and twelve Felpaw Ravagers.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2000206576779211bf6700e5b21e09e118cddd297934f221d369156d200ee1c2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4121]={["aftermath"]="The transfer earned recognition and an audience with the Warlord about the final mission.",["atomIDs"]={"4121:description:1-87","4121:description:89-252","4121:description:257-278","4121:objective:1-113","4121:objective:118-227","4121:objective:232-303"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4121:completion:1-42","4121:completion:44-72","4121:completion:74-141"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Escort Grark Lorkrub through Blackrock Mountain to Lexlort's men and surrender the shackles.",["opening"]="Grark mocked the prospect of escaping a fortified Blackrock stronghold with him in custody. Lexlort's men waited beyond the mountain in the Searing Gorge, leaving a dangerous crossing between capture and transfer.",["pending"]="{actor} would escort Grark through the mountain to the waiting guards.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Grark into custody and returned the Thorium Shackles.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="0304aa2d84f718c5d1cd13abb36297565ec6a7448ea6d06c580c1340e10e6215",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4122]={["aftermath"]="Grark defended the power offered by joining Blackrock rather than accepting the charge against him.",["atomIDs"]={"4122:description:1-91","4122:description:93-203","4122:description:205-234","4122:description:239-322","4122:description:327-350","4122:description:352-429","4122:description:431-461","4122:objective:1-53","4122:objective:55-138","4122:objective:143-279","4122:objective:281-359"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4122:completion:1-69"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bind Grark with Thorium Shackles and begin returning him to Lexlort's custody.",["opening"]="Lexlort had tracked Grark into the protection of Blackrock orcs and accused him of passing them operational intelligence. Capturing the suspected traitor required special shackles and an escort back through the mountain.",["pending"]="{actor} would find Grark in the fortress and bind him for the return.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} bound Grark Lorkrub with the Thorium Shackles.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="362344d0dc1b869950b00e37390eef4a8f4a4ceab7eac17d91b6316d8265f3b9",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4123]={["aftermath"]="Maxwort found the gem even more beautiful than he had imagined and offered payment for its recovery.",["atomIDs"]={"4123:description:1-38","4123:description:41-110","4123:description:113-213","4123:description:218-243","4123:description:248-344","4123:description:347-465","4123:description:470-479","4123:objective:1-76"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4123:completion:1-19","4123:completion:21-28","4123:completion:30-71","4123:completion:76-108"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover the Heart of the Mountain from the Lower Vault for Maxwort.",["opening"]="Maxwort had pursued the fist-sized Heart of the Mountain for years, but the Dark Irons refused to sell it. He now wanted it taken from their secret safe, a breach that would first draw out Watchman Doomgrip.",["pending"]="{actor} would breach the Lower Vault and recover the gem.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Heart of the Mountain to Maxwort.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="909995536d05b66fd8aa03b59524fc30b207b233ce82973b1f59a11fc6388b01",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4124]={["atomIDs"]={"4124:description:1-137","4124:description:140-260","4124:description:263-332","4124:description:337-405","4124:description:408-469","4124:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="A week of failed searching had left Feathermoon's courier declared missing in action. Ginro Hearthkindle still sought help finding both the messenger and his parcels.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to speak with Ginro about the missing courier.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Ginro Hearthkindle about the courier.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="11414b5bc8204c604201065bc0f1ab6299f62a8e1e4eb51b54c08bd4ab95c52e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4125]={["atomIDs"]={"4125:description:1-73","4125:description:76-176","4125:description:179-301","4125:description:306-349","4125:description:352-392","4125:description:395-445","4125:description:448-492","4125:objective:1-63"},["bridge"]="The inquiry had reached Ginro, who described Raschal's intended coastal boat route to Thalanaar. Finding the missing vessel offered the next chance to recover his trail.",["bridgeFrom"]=4124,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Raschal had planned to row along the coast before crossing southern Feralas toward Thalanaar, avoiding the Horde camp. Ginro could not find his boat; hidden or sunk, it remained the best possible clue.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to locate Raschal's boat on the Feralas coast.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search for the courier's boat.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="7a57f3ee4185e1d54096a0f9584ddae474d3956d4b3656c664ddbf3e501c93e2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4126]={["aftermath"]="Ragnar welcomed the recipe home and offered the Thunderbrews' gratitude.",["atomIDs"]={"4126:description:1-125","4126:description:128-140","4126:description:143-178","4126:description:183-214","4126:description:217-363","4126:description:368-460","4126:objective:1-68"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4126:completion:1-13","4126:completion:15-24","4126:completion:26-103","4126:completion:108-148","4126:completion:150-174"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover the stolen Thunderbrew Lager recipe from Blackrock Depths for Ragnar.",["opening"]="Hurley Blackbreath's Dark Irons had stolen a treasured Thunderbrew recipe. Ragnar wanted his family's work recovered and the stolen lager destroyed, turning a dispute over brewing into a dangerous expedition beneath Blackrock.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek the recipe and destroy the stolen lager.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the lost lager recipe to Ragnar.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="90bd80ae3e3ef5349e787963ca2c959add47e2a43fef9cfa57f53c82fafa06fe",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4127]={["atomIDs"]={"4127:description:1-74","4127:description:77-180","4127:description:183-267","4127:description:272-410","4127:description:413-486","4127:objective:1-96"},["opening"]="A cared-for knife lay in the mud beside the damaged boat. Its connection to the missing passenger remained a possibility, but Ginro had asked for any recovered clue to return.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to show the Discarded Knife to Ginro.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Discarded Knife to Ginro Hearthkindle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="0d139b8e8ea6a2fc8af250da7f93b34207a8908943bf92b06096fb410a2e18c3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4128]={["aftermath"]="Ragnar explained that the theft concerned a family recipe and blamed the Dark Iron dwarves.",["atomIDs"]={"4128:description:10-88","4128:description:91-155","4128:description:160-195","4128:description:198-259","4128:objective:1-30"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4128:completion:1-21","4128:completion:24-40","4128:completion:43-78","4128:completion:81-94","4128:completion:97-159","4128:completion:162-171","4128:completion:173-194"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Visit Ragnar Thunderbrew at the distillery in Kharanos.",["opening"]="Word of Ragnar's anger had spread beyond Kharanos: someone had stolen his ale, and he was paying for help. The distillery offered the place to hear the grievance directly.",["pending"]="{actor} would visit Ragnar at the distillery.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="0ff05ad48acf2676868d592b606d8e95fb0662e94580631e400c7a2eecc1f782",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4129]={["atomIDs"]={"4129:description:1-63","4129:description:65-79","4129:description:82-165","4129:description:168-257","4129:description:260-339","4129:description:344-501","4129:objective:1-72"},["bridge"]="The knife had reached Ginro from the wreckage. He proposed Quintis's gift of reading histories by touch, with an old card debt as encouragement to perform the reading.",["bridgeFrom"]=4127,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Ginro knew Quintis could read an object's past by touch. The druid's gambling debt offered an incentive to apply that gift to the discarded knife.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the Discarded Knife to Quintis for a reading.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Discarded Knife to Quintis Jonespyre.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="c26695979c79c3c4a3ce838305fc7e6483c04a01bed74a459a4efbdbbdf3e5cb",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4130]={["aftermath"]="Ginro doubted ordinary gnolls could have terrified Raschal. The vision supplied a direction without explaining the source of that fear.",["atomIDs"]={"4130:description:1-33","4130:description:36-74","4130:description:79-183","4130:description:186-206","4130:description:208-264","4130:description:267-321","4130:description:324-406","4130:description:409-421","4130:description:423-433","4130:description:438-462","4130:description:465-488","4130:description:491-507","4130:objective:1-56"},["bridge"]="The knife had reached Quintis and yielded fragmented visions. He described backpacks, Woodpaw and unnoticed water elementals, then sent the account back to Ginro without claiming to know Raschal's ultimate fate.",["bridgeFrom"]=4129,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4130:completion:1-51","4130:completion:54-131","4130:completion:136-243","4130:completion:246-350"},["opening"]="Quintis described visions of Raschal taking backpacks inland, returning after meeting Woodpaw gnolls, then failing to notice elementals behind him. The images stopped there, leaving their meaning for Ginro to assess.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to report Quintis's visions to Ginro.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} relayed the psychometric reading to Ginro Hearthkindle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="7140c4a8c40620e508deebe4c5cd68f5187cae05fab4f4c1be453958b9e15c5b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4131]={["aftermath"]="Two leather backpacks bearing Feathermoon insignia hung on a nearby tree. The search had reached belongings matching the vision.",["atomIDs"]={"4131:description:1-112","4131:description:115-161","4131:description:166-399","4131:description:402-503","4131:objective:1-115"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4131:completion:1-59","4131:completion:62-146"},["opening"]="Ginro doubted that the Woodpaw had ultimately taken Raschal, but they remained the best lead. Their habit of keeping scavenged belongings made the camps worth searching for the backpacks in Quintis's vision.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search the Woodpaw camps for Raschal or his belongings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search for the courier's evidence in the Woodpaw camps.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2a8a91865c77ff8661154226b25e695e7635fcb6e335c5f0c8303021fd4e0b78",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4132]={["aftermath"]="Goretooth praised the deed as justice and offered recognition for service to the Horde and the expeditionary force.",["atomIDs"]={"4132:description:1-35","4132:description:37-84","4132:description:89-198","4132:description:200-263","4132:description:268-372","4132:objective:1-55","4132:objective:57-110"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4132:completion:1-8","4132:completion:10-45","4132:completion:47-82","4132:completion:84-170"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat General Angerforge and report to Goretooth.",["opening"]="The campaign now reached the commander Goretooth blamed for the massacre of his 109th division. Angerforge's death was presented as justice for those lost soldiers, beyond the earlier strikes against his troops.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek General Angerforge in Blackrock Depths.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Angerforge and reported to Goretooth.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="f0ec9d1d83abb74a146868a68f24df1a720a7e08edfb65322037ea9e87595303",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4133]={["atomIDs"]={"4133:description:1-56","4133:description:59-200","4133:description:205-222","4133:description:225-239","4133:objective:1-50"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Meet Vivian Lagrave in Kargath about a Dark Iron brew.",["opening"]="Vivian's investigation in the Badlands concerned rumors of a drink made by Blackrock's Dark Irons. She needed help from someone willing to hear the proposal in Kargath.",["pending"]="{actor} would consult Vivian about the rumored brew.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="4be3ed2cfb99d9cb482e368702a2544f6c2d06001bd2b81b261e96a80e4c19d4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4134]={["aftermath"]="Vivian intended to send it to the Apothecarium, amused by the prospect of turning a dwarven drink against its makers.",["atomIDs"]={"4134:description:1-80","4134:description:83-173","4134:description:176-202","4134:description:205-263","4134:description:265-315","4134:description:320-427","4134:description:432-507","4134:objective:1-63"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4134:completion:1-10","4134:completion:12-109","4134:completion:111-200","4134:completion:205-233","4134:completion:235-288","4134:completion:290-302"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover Hurley's stolen lager recipe for Vivian in Kargath.",["opening"]="Vivian had heard that Thunderbrew Lager lent its drinkers strength and courage. She wanted the stolen recipe studied for uses serving the Forsaken, suggesting that threatening Hurley's ale might draw him out.",["pending"]="{actor} would find Hurley and obtain the recipe for Vivian.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the lager recipe to Vivian.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="aae49439b1b1e1c3a1b8817ef709b27623cee6f0fe60c3ab0f9e6160d342742c",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4135]={["atomIDs"]={"4135:description:1-158","4135:description:163-282","4135:description:285-391","4135:description:394-438","4135:description:443-508","4135:objective:1-129","4135:objective:132-208"},["bridge"]="The camp search had reached backpacks bearing Feathermoon's insignia. Inside, a note signed by Raschal described the insects of the Writhing Deep and his decision to investigate them himself.",["bridgeFrom"]=4131,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="The backpacks contained Thalanaar's parcel and a note signed by Raschal. His report of insect-like creatures in the Writhing Deep explained the investigation that drew him south of the gnoll camps.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to continue the search for Raschal in the Writhing Deep.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assigned search in the Writhing Deep.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="41a0eadda2a1eeb38ca4a85fa9a40df32be79c925275212926cc45e5c31c8af3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4136]={["aftermath"]="Yuka regretted missing her brother's reaction to the family's plan to surrender him to Revilgaz, but celebrated the outcome.",["atomIDs"]={"4136:description:1-117","4136:description:122-244","4136:description:247-301","4136:description:304-347","4136:description:352-401","4136:description:404-440","4136:description:445-483","4136:description:485-507","4136:objective:1-63"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4136:completion:1-4","4136:completion:6-19","4136:completion:21-26","4136:completion:28-88","4136:completion:90-101","4136:completion:103-202","4136:completion:207-220","4136:completion:222-254","4136:completion:256-308"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Ribbly's head to Yuka Screwspigot.",["opening"]="Ribbly's schemes had exhausted his family's patience and earned a bounty from Revilgaz. Yuka saw a chance to profit from her troublesome brother, who had taken refuge inside Blackrock Depths.",["pending"]="{actor} would find Ribbly in the Depths and answer Yuka's bounty.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Ribbly's head to Yuka.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="bbefc61a6901f661d9990dc5f34724728c5bb98b3a1d5d0a12491c8a6bd4e002",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4141]={["aftermath"]="Muigin recalled the plants attacking when he tried to jump over one. Their unexpected behavior kept his idea of training them an experiment rather than an established practice.",["atomIDs"]={"4141:description:1-22","4141:description:24-49","4141:description:54-113","4141:description:115-177","4141:description:179-244","4141:description:249-310","4141:description:312-415","4141:description:420-471","4141:description:473-508","4141:objective:1-44"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4141:completion:1-49","4141:completion:51-95","4141:completion:100-126","4141:completion:128-142","4141:completion:144-184"},["opening"]="Muigin blamed Larion for their predicament and turned the quarrel toward Un'Goro's strange plants. He thought they might obey commands if trained, requesting fifteen bloodpetals to begin the study.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather fifteen Bloodpetals for Muigin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered fifteen Bloodpetals to Muigin.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="205a7a6ca31c42ae695e2c615700e0caeb6a1afd5f335e8c9453d36b5b92d960",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4142]={["aftermath"]="Gregan asked to hear the plan before deciding how to help. Identifying the bloodpetal did not itself establish that Muigin's intended control would work.",["atomIDs"]={"4142:description:1-44","4142:description:46-58","4142:description:60-103","4142:description:108-129","4142:description:131-161","4142:description:166-244","4142:description:246-282","4142:description:287-323","4142:description:325-403","4142:objective:1-50"},["bridge"]="The bloodpetals had reached Muigin, who suspected a little intelligence in the plants. He sent a specimen to Gregan Brewspewer for judgment beyond his own expertise.",["bridgeFrom"]=4141,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4142:completion:1-15","4142:completion:17-23","4142:completion:25-112"},["opening"]="Muigin suspected the plants possessed a little intelligence but doubted his own expertise. Gregan Brewspewer in northern Feralas was the wilderness specialist he wanted to examine a specimen.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take a Bloodpetal to Gregan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered a Bloodpetal to Gregan Brewspewer.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="7f1ae52f15ed83baeed6a70851aaba4425c1fbfcfe970aa08b32f6af8356e356",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4143]={["aftermath"]="Muigin hesitated to touch the haze but accepted Gregan's recommendation as a reason to try. The material's delivery did not record the plants successfully controlled.",["atomIDs"]={"4143:description:1-78","4143:description:80-125","4143:description:130-209","4143:description:211-305","4143:description:310-380","4143:description:382-471","4143:description:473-486","4143:objective:1-75"},["bridge"]="The plant specimen had reached Gregan. He proposed Atal'ai Haze from the Sunken Temple as the material Muigin needed to attempt control of the strange creatures.",["bridgeFrom"]=4142,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4143:completion:1-52","4143:completion:54-118"},["opening"]="Gregan had never seen such plants, but proposed Atal'ai Haze to control them. Samples could be taken from creatures deep within the Sunken Temple and returned to Muigin's experiment.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to obtain five Atal'ai Haze samples for Muigin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered five samples of Atal'ai Haze to Muigin.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="ed716ceca80e29831c0299a7478477ab34861737a8d4855a14bafa28234b1935",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4145]={["atomIDs"]={"4145:description:1-22","4145:description:24-49","4145:description:54-141","4145:description:146-223","4145:description:225-331","4145:description:336-385","4145:description:387-438","4145:objective:1-129"},["opening"]="Larion blamed Muigin for their being lost and resented the plant pests sent to annoy him. Rather than speak to his companion, he sought to reduce the creatures supplying the quarrel.",["pending"]="{actor} would undertake Larion's assignment against five of each specified Bloodpetal kind.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment against five Lashers, five Threshers, five Flayers and five Trappers for Larion.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f406fdf78f34bd3f5c0c26790c5132a575c43c8bb25c5550dad94578ed024b8a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4146]={["aftermath"]="Larion accepted the substitute for Marvon's help and examined what had been brought back.",["atomIDs"]={"4146:description:1-19","4146:description:21-138","4146:description:140-234","4146:description:239-328","4146:description:330-419","4146:description:421-499","4146:objective:1-88"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4146:completion:1-25","4146:completion:27-61"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring the unloaded zapper and five Atal'ai haze samples to Larion.",["opening"]="With Marvon absent, a new bug-zapper prototype offered another answer to Larion's Bloodpetal problem. Its fuel had to come from the worms and oozes inhabiting Atal'Hakkar's temple, making a local nuisance depend on a distant expedition.",["pending"]="{actor} would obtain Atal'ai haze and carry the zapper to Marshal's Refuge.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the prototype and its fuel to Larion.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="614e8b0ee9501819021235e640d40bcf97b6b5ae17809d3565a559f0254564f0",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4147]={["aftermath"]="Liv explained that Marvon had gone to study Tanaris's ruins. The workshop inquiry therefore reached his apprentice rather than the absent inventor.",["atomIDs"]={"4147:description:1-96","4147:description:101-139","4147:description:141-165","4147:description:167-188","4147:description:190-219","4147:description:224-295","4147:description:298-368","4147:objective:1-51"},["bridge"]="The first reduction of the plants had not ended Larion's trouble. He had discovered Muigin growing more, and now sought an engineered answer from Marvon's workshop.",["bridgeFrom"]=4145,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4147:completion:1-45","4147:completion:47-110","4147:completion:115-156"},["opening"]="Larion discovered that Muigin was growing the pests himself. He rejected reconciliation in favor of a gadget from Marvon's Ratchet workshop, hoping engineering could answer the plants.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to visit Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the Ratchet workshop and spoke with Liv Rizzlefix.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="ec3b2fd683754ced9dbe0bd027db72d779ae72368f871b574d6276937894d080",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4161]={["aftermath"]="Zarrin placed his pupil within the balance the night elves sought to preserve, including during troubled times.",["atomIDs"]={"4161:description:1-205","4161:description:210-296","4161:description:298-384","4161:description:386-423","4161:description:428-509","4161:objective:1-51"},["availabilityQualification"]={["basis"]="Catalog states positive beta server experience; confirms reported definition, not that a player can reach its giver in the target release",["currentServerPlayableConfirmed"]=false,["eligibility"]="BETA_SERVER_DEFINED_PUBLISHER_CLAIM",["sourceReceipt"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639 ; https://tierhall.app/wow/quests/4161 ; https://warcraftforever.games/quests/4161 ; https://wowfwiki.com/wiki/Quests"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4161:completion:1-48","4161:completion:50-151"},["opening"]="Zarrin taught restraint through a small harvest. He described the kaldorei's balance with nature as taking only what was needed and returning in kind, then requested exactly seven spider legs.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather seven Small Spider Legs for Zarrin in Dolanaar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered seven Small Spider Legs to Zarrin.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f421cf27fd95b82e91182a269c0840dc25ae71f1191ca8af03afc23b1217d1ed",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4181]={["aftermath"]="Nixx welcomed the prospective pupil while emphasizing the intellect and steady hands his explosive discipline demanded.",["atomIDs"]={"4181:description:1-69","4181:description:72-142","4181:description:145-241","4181:description:246-266","4181:description:269-363","4181:description:367-505","4181:objective:1-131"},["availabilityQualification"]={["basis"]="Catalog states positive beta server experience; confirms reported definition, not that a player can reach its giver in the target release",["currentServerPlayableConfirmed"]=false,["eligibility"]="BETA_SERVER_DEFINED_PUBLISHER_CLAIM",["sourceReceipt"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639 ; https://tierhall.app/wow/quests/4181"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4181:completion:1-43","4181:completion:45-176","4181:completion:178-293","4181:completion:298-353"},["opening"]="Lilliam Sparkspindle reluctantly described the goblin engineering branch. She mocked its appetite for explosions but supplied a manual and a referral to Nixx for anyone prepared to make that lasting choice.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="6e6aa9c58588dd462e54c90c856542416bda1baeafd587b3f5f5a8d019d38002",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4182]={["aftermath"]="Helendis accepted the demonstration of ability and was ready to discuss more pressing matters.",["atomIDs"]={"4182:description:1-50","4182:description:55-78","4182:description:80-246","4182:description:251-267","4182:description:269-290","4182:description:292-343","4182:description:345-384","4182:description:386-426","4182:description:428-475","4182:objective:1-82","4182:objective:84-138"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4182:completion:1-19","4182:completion:21-116"},["opening"]="Helendis needed help against dragonkin below the ridge. The struggle took place among ruins whose full history he did not claim to understand.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to push back the four dragonkin groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Helendis's dragonkin assignment.",["sourceHash"]="2a5896358c8d50464db8cc61e4feeaee5825d2f2dc57a53562dc091d50a43cef",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4183]={["atomIDs"]={"4183:description:1-88","4183:description:90-156","4183:description:161-305","4183:description:307-391","4183:description:396-434","4183:description:436-466","4183:description:471-507","4183:objective:1-82"},["opening"]="Helendis identified the black dragons as the power controlling the Blackrock orcs. He suspected they also fueled the orcs' rage and sent the discovery toward Lakeshire.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Helendis's letter to Solomon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the sealed letter to Solomon.",["sourceHash"]="f90c911e931ac58ea829a3d1a910deeee49b61e26b89771d38e3938730503d7f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4184]={["aftermath"]="Bolvar initially rejected the news of dragons as impossible.",["atomIDs"]={"4184:description:1-22","4184:description:24-118","4184:description:120-239","4184:description:241-319","4184:description:321-330","4184:description:332-348","4184:description:353-433","4184:description:435-508","4184:objective:1-76","4184:objective:81-113"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4184:completion:1-8","4184:completion:10-20"},["opening"]="Solomon feared Lakeshire could not withstand both dragons and orcs. His appeal to Stormwind followed the possible danger onward toward other towns and the capital.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry the plea to Bolvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Solomon's appeal at Stormwind Keep.",["sourceHash"]="612ea1b427a5fd68223ceb641632446c5b86ba97f8c1f3383d9d3aa23c82391d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4185]={["aftermath"]="Bolvar considered a solution that might answer the competing concerns, without recording its execution yet.",["atomIDs"]={"4185:description:1-32","4185:description:34-129","4185:description:131-181","4185:description:186-213","4185:description:215-277","4185:description:279-331","4185:objective:1-78"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4185:completion:1-45","4185:completion:50-180"},["opening"]="Bolvar refused to commit thinly spread troops without proof. He directed the inquiry to Prestor, whose knowledge of dragons might clarify the claim.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to consult Prestor and return to Bolvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the consultation and spoke with Bolvar.",["sourceHash"]="d68ccd8ca321025a52fe1612ffbc551034357c66bc8cb4153416de88efe61daf",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4186]={["aftermath"]="Solomon regarded the decree as leaving the deputy responsible for Lakeshire's safety.",["atomIDs"]={"4186:description:1-63","4186:description:68-133","4186:objective:1-56"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4186:completion:1-38","4186:completion:43-78","4186:completion:83-154","4186:completion:159-206","4186:completion:208-232"},["opening"]="Bolvar chose to empower an acting deputy and issued a decree. Solomon in Lakeshire was to receive the formal response.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Bolvar's decree to Lakeshire.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the decree to Solomon.",["sourceHash"]="7210f4a07940c828d7fe736b544ca4a6de226f72d20119fcae6577c4e112dbf7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4201]={["aftermath"]="Nagmara could now prepare her potion and planned to use it on Rocknot; the delivery itself did not establish his response.",["atomIDs"]={"4201:description:1-22","4201:description:25-71","4201:description:74-86","4201:description:89-103","4201:description:108-124","4201:description:127-231","4201:description:234-392","4201:description:395-431","4201:description:436-491","4201:objective:1-108"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4201:completion:1-19","4201:completion:22-68","4201:completion:71-112","4201:completion:117-130","4201:completion:133-159"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Gather gromsblood, ten giant silver veins and Golakka water for Nagmara.",["opening"]="Nagmara could not win Private Rocknot's attention and proposed a potion to force his affection. The succubus needed gromsblood, veins from Azshara's cliff giants and water from Un'Goro's Golakka Springs.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather the potion's ingredients for Nagmara.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Nagmara's requested ingredients.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="978f1a61f809857cc5381876a725d7cea2c850324de3581ee7d93ac949d8f2a8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4223]={["atomIDs"]={"4223:description:1-27","4223:description:32-74","4223:description:76-151","4223:description:153-162","4223:objective:1-50"},["opening"]="Solomon directed the new deputy back into the Steppes. Reporting to Maxwell was the next duty under Stormwind's decree.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to report to Maxwell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Maxwell in the Steppes.",["sourceHash"]="56c80a24aaa8de391f9289588162f7d352f4b20c15d7009c777fadcc072901bd",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4224]={["atomIDs"]={"4224:description:1-5","4224:description:7-37","4224:description:39-91","4224:description:96-237","4224:description:239-296","4224:description:301-335","4224:description:337-363","4224:description:365-437","4224:description:440-479","4224:objective:1-122","4224:objective:127-206"},["opening"]="Maxwell's intelligence had vanished with Windsor after a Blackrock raid. Ragged John had been present and might establish the marshal's fate.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to question John and return with the findings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the inquiry and reported to Maxwell.",["sourceHash"]="b386beb119e6dfa4db54b052bf847cce2882f1de7b566337d4c5d36f0f596687",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4241]={["atomIDs"]={"4241:description:1-63","4241:description:68-113","4241:description:115-161","4241:description:163-189","4241:description:194-210","4241:description:215-270","4241:objective:1-73","4241:objective:75-114","4241:objective:119-193"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Find out what happened to Marshal Windsor inside Blackrock Depths.",["opening"]="Ragged John's report offered hope that Windsor still lived in Blackrock's prison. Maxwell sent the search into the Depths, asking for his return if possible or definite proof if he had died.",["pending"]="{actor} would search the prison for Windsor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Marshal Windsor alive.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="e296e93ebc42510c3092bf2ed0677dc4742cb51f0bdf701d9cecd722ad2abdd8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4242]={["aftermath"]="Maxwell interpreted Windsor's behavior as madness and considered the inquiry a dead end.",["atomIDs"]={"4242:description:1-17","4242:description:19-96","4242:description:101-122","4242:description:124-179","4242:description:184-209","4242:description:211-215","4242:description:217-230","4242:description:235-379","4242:description:384-396","4242:objective:1-34"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4242:completion:1-26","4242:completion:31-68","4242:completion:73-170","4242:completion:172-206","4242:completion:211-258"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Give Maxwell Windsor's report of lost evidence.",["opening"]="Windsor's bitterness centered on the proof he had gathered for Bolvar and then lost. With his evidence seemingly unrecoverable, he dismissed the messenger and spoke angrily of confronting those he blamed in Stormwind.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Windsor's bleak account to Maxwell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported Windsor's lost evidence to Maxwell.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="979a1796e11d8912251c00cebee0ee127f184a4d01dc5027e3a7dad4f89be8ad",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4243]={["aftermath"]="The mechanical ape bore dents in its shoulder and head, with no power apparent in its components. The search had found a damaged machine in need of repair.",["atomIDs"]={"4243:description:1-69","4243:description:71-108","4243:description:110-235","4243:description:240-303","4243:description:305-398","4243:description:400-480","4243:description:485-509","4243:objective:1-31"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4243:completion:1-126","4243:completion:128-191","4243:completion:196-274"},["opening"]="Karna had built A-Me 01 to observe Un'Goro's apes from within their own company. Contact through her scrying eyes failed at Fungal Rock after an alpha male approached the mechanical ape.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find A-Me 01 at Fungal Rock.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found A-Me 01 in Un'Goro Crater.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="a6c6c486f64488960025a5d4e0f719a317c815addbb67f414ad50d94cada6667",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4244]={["aftermath"]="The replacement casing fitted after the burned-out one was removed. Cycling the power remained the next test, since the casing's fault was still an assumption.",["atomIDs"]={"4244:description:1-62","4244:description:64-167","4244:description:172-318","4244:description:323-347","4244:objective:1-62"},["bridge"]="The search had found A-Me damaged and without apparent power. A maintenance panel instructed replacement of a Mithril Casing before the machine could be tested again.",["bridgeFrom"]=4243,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4244:completion:1-124","4244:completion:126-162","4244:completion:164-315"},["opening"]="A panel on A-Me revealed a simple repair instruction: replace the Mithril Casing and cycle the power. Whether that would restore the mechanical ape still needed to be tested.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring a Mithril Casing to A-Me 01.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered a Mithril Casing to A-Me 01.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="a36599f1cc2add4b766b758a09e1b06f65e51836ad9992ac92ac2128de0fcfc8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4245]={["aftermath"]="Karna welcomed A-Me back and expected further work to repair her dents. Safe return had not made every part of the machine perfect.",["atomIDs"]={"4245:description:1-118","4245:description:120-275","4245:description:280-306","4245:description:308-348","4245:objective:1-57"},["bridge"]="The new casing had reached A-Me. Cycling the power began the next test: escorting the mechanical ape out of danger and back to Karna.",["bridgeFrom"]=4244,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4245:completion:1-19","4245:completion:21-30","4245:completion:32-45","4245:completion:50-67","4245:completion:69-92","4245:completion:94-156","4245:completion:161-180","4245:completion:182-204"},["opening"]="The power switch was ready to be turned back on after the repair. Gorillas still surrounded the area, leaving the journey back to Karna as the next test for A-Me's recovery.",["pending"]="{actor} would escort A-Me 01 back to Karna Remtravel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed A-Me 01's escort to Karna Remtravel.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="d15afd4554689f0a6d696a8d2eacf11e08fcfc48fa75d829be087641da96b4e6",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4261]={["aftermath"]="Kayneth welcomed the kind deed as one contribution toward a reclamation still in the future.",["atomIDs"]={"4261:description:1-46","4261:description:48-74","4261:description:76-111","4261:description:116-171","4261:description:173-199","4261:description:204-290","4261:description:292-316","4261:description:318-410","4261:description:415-507","4261:objective:1-94"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4261:completion:1-8","4261:completion:10-48","4261:completion:50-82","4261:completion:87-172"},["opening"]="Arei remained bound to the suffering of land corrupted during the Legion's assault. The ancient spirit sought a path home and rest, with word afterward due to a druid in Forest Song.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to guide Arei out and speak with Kayneth.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the escort and delivered the report.",["sourceHash"]="d0fc9c563464b4376af6d24040ef9794f8ff1ed15e381008d0f206023daeba46",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4262]={["aftermath"]="The name Incendius alarmed Jalinda, turning the report of Pyron's defeat into a warning of another power deeper in Blackrock.",["atomIDs"]={"4262:description:1-141","4262:description:146-222","4262:description:227-319","4262:description:321-421","4262:description:426-472","4262:objective:1-50","4262:objective:55-113","4262:objective:115-146"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4262:completion:1-10","4262:completion:12-21"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Overmaster Pyron at Blackrock Quarry for Jalinda.",["opening"]="Pyron guarded the quarry approach to Blackrock Depths, blocking Jalinda's expedition. Her scorched and missing mages made removing the elemental a necessity before another team could enter.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Pyron at the quarry and clear the expedition's approach.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Overmaster Pyron and reported to Jalinda.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="b16b6e914218240f6a0b2e0864cfb30c8f7a4408157770e78853fbaa39e96f09",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4263]={["atomIDs"]={"4263:description:1-49","4263:description:54-77","4263:description:82-136","4263:description:138-156","4263:description:158-177","4263:description:182-225","4263:description:227-264","4263:description:269-349","4263:description:354-400","4263:objective:1-56"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths for Jalinda.",["opening"]="Pyron's mention of Incendius alarmed Jalinda, who had heard the fiery lord served Ragnaros. She feared Pyron would keep returning from the ashes unless the power restoring him was removed.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek and destroy Incendius.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Incendius and returned to Jalinda.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="58fac45747c6ab0e5c5a4c2d7d139ff5c326de530c2a57c3dbd231466c2903cf",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4264]={["atomIDs"]={"4264:description:1-41","4264:description:43-101","4264:description:106-122","4264:description:127-163","4264:description:168-282","4264:description:287-353","4264:description:358-420","4264:description:425-451","4264:objective:1-94","4264:objective:96-124"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring the stained note to Marshal Windsor.",["opening"]="A barely readable note credited Angerforge with finding the pattern in Windsor's encryption and said Argelmach was finishing the deciphering. The lost information might still exist, making the scrap a reason to return to the imprisoned marshal.",["pending"]="{actor} would show Windsor the recovered note.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the stained note to Windsor.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="6c6d444a9ce7cf4164154cc6aff35e08893c7b532cbb8b5cc431d6c9ac5917b9",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4265]={["aftermath"]="Ginro said Raschal had already checked in and described the rescue. The long search ended in the courier's return rather than recovery of remains.",["atomIDs"]={"4265:description:1-106","4265:description:109-161","4265:description:164-215","4265:description:220-258","4265:description:266-348","4265:description:351-383","4265:description:388-439","4265:objective:1-36","4265:objective:41-143"},["bridge"]="The note had led the search into the Writhing Deep, where Raschal was found alive in a pod. He needed release from the hive and his survival reported to Ginro.",["bridgeFrom"]=4135,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4265:completion:1-17","4265:completion:20-88","4265:completion:98-316","4265:completion:319-351","4265:completion:354-415"},["opening"]="A pod revealed Raschal alive, stunned by captivity rather than dead. He said the insects had overwhelmed him and left him paralyzed inside; Ginro needed to hear that the missing courier had survived.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to free Raschal from the hive and report his survival to Ginro.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Raschal's release and reported him alive and well to Ginro Hearthkindle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="a5778d2290401969723a3e4d9e281a1ec33414dc15b941f6580567bc30733a9f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4266]={["aftermath"]="Shandris thanked the rescuer and turned toward a new mission prompted by the hive. The personal search had exposed a broader danger.",["atomIDs"]={"4266:description:1-73","4266:description:76-266","4266:description:269-312","4266:description:314-343","4266:description:348-407","4266:objective:1-58"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4266:completion:1-61","4266:completion:64-163","4266:completion:166-237","4266:completion:242-257","4266:completion:259-301","4266:completion:304-415"},["opening"]="Shandris wanted a personal meeting after the courier's rescue. Ginro expected thanks, but knew the general also required an account of the frightening insects encountered in southern Feralas.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Shandris Feathermoon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Shandris Feathermoon about the rescue and Zukk'ash.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8e0f8858d4e2753843598a69947332c7feae427398d16896e106f8d9adef20cc",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4267]={["aftermath"]="Gracina identified the insects as silithid and warned that they served a much greater threat. Her concern reached beyond Feralas to both Horde and Alliance.",["atomIDs"]={"4267:description:1-102","4267:description:105-220","4267:description:223-324","4267:description:327-430","4267:description:435-496","4267:objective:1-59"},["bridge"]="The rescue account had reached Shandris, who sent Raschal's infestation report beyond the stronghold. Gracina Spiritmight's knowledge in Darnassus could place the newly discovered hive in a wider danger.",["bridgeFrom"]=4266,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4267:completion:1-58","4267:completion:61-107","4267:completion:112-233","4267:completion:236-305","4267:completion:308-406","4267:completion:411-480"},["opening"]="Shandris entrusted a copy of Raschal's infestation report to Gracina Spiritmight. The Darnassus priestess knew such creatures, and the general wanted that knowledge brought to bear alongside the formal filing.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver Raschal's Report to Gracina.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Raschal's Report to Gracina Spiritmight.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="6039f136936d04ede0e6967ee5e4a6b48d98255eddf5d308fda4efeb1e378204",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4281]={["aftermath"]="Falfindel welcomed the overdue parcel but feared the substitute courier meant trouble for Raschal. His uncertainty was his own, and could coexist with a rescue recorded elsewhere.",["atomIDs"]={"4281:description:1-149","4281:description:152-246","4281:description:251-366","4281:description:369-416","4281:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4281:completion:1-79","4281:completion:84-190","4281:completion:192-224","4281:completion:226-319","4281:completion:321-381","4281:completion:386-413","4281:completion:415-457"},["opening"]="The recovered parcel still had a destination regardless of Raschal's fate. Its handwritten name pointed toward Falfindel Waywarder at the small southeastern way-station of Thalanaar.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the Undelivered Parcel to Falfindel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Undelivered Parcel to Falfindel Waywarder.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="4f516d9da7db0bc35244d7218082cd099ede49d996fd6cf941ef10362a10714d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4282]={["atomIDs"]={"4282:description:1-44","4282:description:49-83","4282:description:88-111","4282:description:113-244","4282:description:246-326","4282:description:331-361","4282:description:366-407","4282:description:409-452","4282:objective:1-42","4282:objective:47-153"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover Windsor's lost information from Angerforge and Argelmach.",["opening"]="The note restored Windsor's hope. He believed Angerforge and Argelmach held the information he had thought lost, turning the search back toward the two Dark Iron leaders and the evidence they had taken.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover Windsor's information from the Dark Iron leaders.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Windsor's recovered information.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="0646bdd218397b8f280c22bdbe289f74dab7e6353bd9ae3914b97d9322dbbe11",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4283]={["atomIDs"]={"4283:description:1-52","4283:description:54-74","4283:description:79-105","4283:description:110-130","4283:description:132-174","4283:description:176-189","4283:description:191-195","4283:description:197-202","4283:description:207-233","4283:description:238-300","4283:description:305-344","4283:description:349-360","4283:description:362-423","4283:description:425-453","4283:description:455-460","4283:description:469-496","4283:description:501-508","4283:objective:1-38","4283:objective:40-126"},["opening"]="Oralius added Blackrock medallions to his collection beside ogre ears. His demand for fifty came amid contradictory claims about the sanity of those around him.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect fifty medallions.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Oralius the requested medallions.",["sourceHash"]="73e6ab0ff7906c625c7c136e4c13c2e0138e02068eec48de86aaf6ef53f96e0b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4284]={["aftermath"]="J.D. could continue experimenting with the replenished crystals. Their supply still preceded an explanation of their power.",["atomIDs"]={"4284:description:1-32","4284:description:34-52","4284:description:57-80","4284:description:82-110","4284:description:115-129","4284:description:131-158","4284:description:160-246","4284:description:248-337","4284:description:339-366","4284:description:371-483","4284:objective:1-69","4284:objective:71-88","4284:objective:90-116"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4284:completion:1-35","4284:completion:37-50"},["opening"]="J.D. sensed unused power in the crystals scattered around the crater, though her experiments had not yet proved it. A dwindling stock led her to request seven crystals of each color.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect seven each of the red, blue, yellow and green Power Crystals.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered seven Power Crystals of each required color to J.D. Collie.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="214f9833a9e75ba9b281f52f1df7ebf7512c591a9fe9b8904efb099fd076ffb1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4285]={["atomIDs"]={"4285:description:1-23","4285:description:25-63","4285:description:68-160","4285:description:162-228","4285:description:233-306","4285:description:308-332","4285:description:334-354","4285:description:356-378","4285:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="Rumors of crystal pylons kept returning to J.D.'s thoughts. One was said to stand nearby in the north, and finding it could begin testing stories she was inclined to believe.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to locate the Northern Crystal Pylon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Northern Crystal Pylon discovery assignment.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="125b4ad0b458ddcf02a46d3156e4fca70edaa90e7681664d448e7f56a17aba31",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4286]={["aftermath"]="Oralius rummaged delightedly through the collection and offered a share of its contents.",["atomIDs"]={"4286:description:1-80","4286:description:82-105","4286:description:110-159","4286:description:164-174","4286:description:176-187","4286:description:192-211","4286:description:213-286","4286:description:291-329","4286:objective:1-64","4286:objective:66-117","4286:objective:119-218"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4286:completion:1-71","4286:completion:76-88","4286:completion:93-156","4286:completion:161-170","4286:completion:172-197","4286:completion:202-227","4286:completion:229-256"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover twenty Dark Iron fanny packs for Oralius.",["opening"]="Oralius insisted that the Dark Irons possessed desirable supplies, citing Captain Winky and answering in a pirate voice himself. Whatever the truth behind that eccentric authority, he wanted samples taken from the Depths.",["pending"]="{actor} would collect the Dark Iron packs for Oralius.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned twenty packs to Oralius.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="15743bb88ee94038e02e69b1fe54b51a8fb511f310b29d73830b75ba2d46a7c6",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4287]={["atomIDs"]={"4287:description:1-122","4287:description:124-195","4287:description:200-351","4287:description:356-405","4287:description:407-465","4287:description:467-495","4287:objective:1-69"},["opening"]="J.D. had heard of large pylons lined with crystals, though she had seen none herself. A rumored eastern structure might connect those stories with the stones scattered through the crater.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to locate the Eastern Crystal Pylon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Eastern Crystal Pylon discovery assignment.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="cf4642d6c997f565c9578430d92a5d45ff1cb01dad2495e9da53fa05d173784a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4288]={["atomIDs"]={"4288:description:1-64","4288:description:66-175","4288:description:180-226","4288:description:228-253","4288:description:255-276","4288:description:281-368","4288:objective:1-51"},["opening"]="The experiments had brought J.D. no positive result. She wondered whether combining colors at a pylon would help, but first needed the rumored structure in the west located.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find the Western Crystal Pylon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Western Crystal Pylon discovery assignment.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="4faa11fc2045d101659f683fb4dd18d290491ca081e9ccdfe8fa7e38fa16a4f7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4289]={["atomIDs"]={"4289:description:1-129","4289:description:131-192","4289:description:194-280","4289:description:285-385","4289:description:387-456","4289:description:458-480","4289:description:482-501","4289:objective:1-140"},["opening"]="Torwa saw the Earth Mother's presence in Un'Goro's creatures. The great northern apes offered a test of strength, with pelts from gorillas, stompers and thunderers as the evidence he requested.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to obtain two pelts from each of the three specified ape kinds.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered two Gorilla Pelts, two Stomper Pelts and two Thunderer Pelts to Torwa.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="92abd4bb871123673363e28a4bbb9eaad29e582c4fa20bc7bcd5d6c10cc98368",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4290]={["atomIDs"]={"4290:description:1-86","4290:description:88-156","4290:description:158-230","4290:description:232-317","4290:description:322-365","4290:description:370-462","4290:description:467-490","4290:objective:1-141"},["opening"]="Torwa remembered Lar'korwi pursuing his brother after meat was taken from the predator's kill. The pursuit ended in his brother's death; stealing from a fresh carcass now offered a way to provoke the same creature.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take a Piece of Threshadon Carcass from Lar'korwi's fresh kill.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Torwa with the Piece of Threshadon Carcass.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="fd748a3ca7d1de749bae7bf33b89427928b797be06c8a4149cdb15fd16e27096",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4291]={["aftermath"]="Torwa accepted the glands as suitable for the final bait. Lar'korwi's appearance and the outcome of that confrontation remained ahead.",["atomIDs"]={"4291:description:1-55","4291:description:57-131","4291:description:136-247","4291:description:249-299","4291:description:301-364","4291:description:366-477","4291:description:479-507","4291:objective:1-90"},["bridge"]="The stolen carcass meat had reached Torwa without drawing Lar'korwi. Two glands from the predator's mates offered the missing scent for a stronger lure.",["bridgeFrom"]=4290,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4291:completion:1-23","4291:completion:25-106","4291:completion:108-171","4291:completion:173-235","4291:completion:237-288"},["opening"]="Lar'korwi had not appeared, so Torwa prepared another lure. Two pheromone glands from the predator's mates near the western eggs could provide the scent needed to bring him out.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to obtain two Ravasaur Pheromone Glands for Torwa.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered two Ravasaur Pheromone Glands to Torwa Pathfinder.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f3d7b8c36ccb666a7f9b27b53c8072b3f8b47ca6065b6713ba0dc7091aefb196",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4292]={["aftermath"]="Torwa paid respect to the completed hunt, judging the result a test of strength and courage worthy of his ancestors' skills.",["atomIDs"]={"4292:description:1-82","4292:description:84-152","4292:description:154-186","4292:description:188-301","4292:description:303-349","4292:description:351-395","4292:description:397-493","4292:objective:1-69","4292:objective:71-154"},["bridge"]="The pheromone glands had reached Torwa. He combined scent with the stolen meat for a final lure on the bone-strewn mountain trail where he last saw Lar'korwi.",["bridgeFrom"]=4291,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4292:completion:1-28","4292:completion:30-44","4292:completion:46-66","4292:completion:68-118","4292:completion:120-141","4292:completion:143-165","4292:completion:167-203","4292:completion:205-230","4292:completion:235-316","4292:completion:318-333"},["opening"]="A small mountain trail strewn with old bones marked Torwa's last sighting of Lar'korwi. Meat and the prepared scent were to be set there together, making the final lure for the confrontation.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon Lar'korwi with Torwa's Pouch and bring back his head.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Lar'korwi lure assignment and delivered his head to Torwa.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="d185c2dcc39af2892842a0eb0c449b0c2824f5dc0451c221fabe71e85ddc7f57",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4293]={["aftermath"]="He found the reactions intriguing and expected further investigation to test Sylvanas's hunch.",["atomIDs"]={"4293:description:1-74","4293:description:76-153","4293:description:155-307","4293:description:312-466","4293:objective:1-63","4293:objective:65-181","4293:objective:183-249"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4293:completion:1-14","4293:completion:16-44","4293:completion:46-71","4293:completion:76-154","4293:completion:156-284","4293:completion:286-320","4293:completion:322-373","4293:completion:375-429"},["opening"]="Fuely wanted a control group from Felwood's corrupted slimes. Collected specimens first had to be tested beside his workstation so the most tainted could be selected.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring five tested corrupt samples.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Fuely with the selected Felwood material.",["sourceHash"]="55c79b0251cc9446c4c76e3b71581fb2cd3729a221db42ce00dae35243904d6f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4294]={["aftermath"]="Fuely speculated about an elemental nature and possible Old God connection, while insisting more tests were needed.",["atomIDs"]={"4294:description:1-41","4294:description:43-152","4294:description:157-180","4294:description:182-260","4294:description:262-308","4294:description:313-359","4294:description:361-457","4294:objective:1-70","4294:objective:72-185","4294:objective:187-248"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4294:completion:1-18","4294:completion:20-84","4294:completion:86-140","4294:completion:145-161","4294:completion:163-198","4294:completion:200-232","4294:completion:234-276","4294:completion:278-292","4294:completion:294-313","4294:completion:315-330","4294:completion:332-445","4294:completion:450-479"},["opening"]="The reportedly untouched crater offered a comparison to Felwood. Fuely wanted its oozes tested for purity rather than assuming the explorers' account proved them free of corruption.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver five tested pure samples.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the selected Un'Goro specimens.",["sourceHash"]="88159516ff04e893df999be73814c60f55a2fec40896c82d77b8920e88fcb291",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4296]={["atomIDs"]={"4296:description:1-66","4296:description:69-183","4296:description:188-206","4296:description:209-215","4296:description:220-290","4296:description:293-405","4296:description:408-458","4296:description:461-496","4296:objective:1-72"},["opening"]="Maxwort followed stories of seven learned dwarves in pursuit of wealth. A tablet rumored to remain in Thaurissan might supply the knowledge he hoped to profit from.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to copy the tablet's text.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the transcript to Maxwort.",["sourceHash"]="3cd423bbb67cf9435e31c27bc3673ce899fdc338d8287881d0b624e522c6f4fc",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4297]={["aftermath"]="Agnar judged the egg almost ready to hatch once the food arrived. The care was moving from preparation toward the first responsibility for a hatchling.",["atomIDs"]={"4297:description:1-75","4297:description:77-128","4297:description:130-219","4297:description:221-315","4297:description:317-376","4297:description:381-505","4297:objective:1-68"},["bridge"]="The fragile egg had reached Agnar in time. He would tend it while five Silvermane Stalker Flanks were gathered for the omnivorous hatchling's first food.",["bridgeFrom"]=3843,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4297:completion:1-89","4297:completion:91-107","4297:completion:109-153","4297:completion:155-228"},["opening"]="Agnar explained that sprite darters ate both plants and meat. He would tend the egg while food was gathered for the expected hatchling: five raw flanks from Silvermane stalkers.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to obtain five Silvermane Stalker Flanks for Agnar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered five Silvermane Stalker Flanks to Agnar Beastamer.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="74c07e84eafed2889536c354ae4129746cbba6898822e3e898f631ba72fc03e9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4298]={["aftermath"]="Agnar returned the egg so the hatchling could bond with its caretaker. He treated that bond as the beginning of parenthood, while the actual exchange remained the egg's return.",["atomIDs"]={"4298:description:1-47","4298:objective:1-44"},["bridge"]="The food had reached Agnar, but the egg was even closer to hatching than he expected. Another conversation would place the final moment of care back with its intended keeper.",["bridgeFrom"]=4297,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4298:completion:1-21","4298:completion:23-102","4298:completion:107-119","4298:completion:121-138","4298:completion:140-145"},["opening"]="Agnar found the egg further along than he had expected. The next moment of its care required another conversation with the animal handler.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to speak with Agnar as the egg neared hatching.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Agnar Beastamer at the final incubation exchange.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="71b35a0d57505bfe39f485da01c6f9d1c18a6f03f1de14776f4b2b2d3d60db43",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4300]={["aftermath"]="He welcomed their timely arrival and considered fashioning a weapon from them.",["atomIDs"]={"4300:description:1-81","4300:description:83-126","4300:description:131-183","4300:description:185-266","4300:description:268-283","4300:description:285-294","4300:description:296-338","4300:description:340-400","4300:description:402-456","4300:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4300:completion:1-20","4300:completion:22-35","4300:completion:37-78","4300:completion:80-92","4300:completion:97-152","4300:completion:154-169"},["opening"]="Jes'rimon's clients valued weapons made from rare pale ravasaur claws. The commission sent the search toward Un'Goro, where only some raptors carried the required white specimens.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover eight white claws.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered them to Jes'rimon.",["sourceHash"]="cd5fd77266fffc6c7aeafef0a4048ce466a1505e162ca2834003e4d54d71c771",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4301]={["aftermath"]="Torwa acknowledged U'cha's great strength and treated the returned pelt as reason to honor the hunter's accomplishment.",["atomIDs"]={"4301:description:1-118","4301:description:120-187","4301:description:189-301","4301:description:306-398","4301:description:400-434","4301:description:436-505","4301:objective:1-73"},["bridge"]="The ape-pelt assignment had returned to Torwa. He singled out the enormous U'cha among the northern gorillas as a greater test of the hunter's strength.",["bridgeFrom"]=4289,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4301:completion:1-14","4301:completion:16-28","4301:completion:30-68","4301:completion:73-123","4301:completion:125-202","4301:completion:204-215","4301:completion:220-280","4301:completion:282-300"},["opening"]="Torwa had seen a huge ape among the northern gorillas and named him U'cha. He offered to acknowledge a great hunter upon receiving the pelt of a creature he held among the Earth Mother's greatest sons.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring U'cha's Pelt to Torwa.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered U'cha's Pelt to Torwa Pathfinder.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="eb2f622f21aeea00fa09237d70c94ad8e01d7fb3e3c51dfd0f49698c7494f37f",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4321]={["aftermath"]="J.D. compiled the findings into a manual while still hoping her diagrams were correct. The calculations offered guidance without claiming infallibility.",["atomIDs"]={"4321:description:1-73","4321:description:78-122","4321:description:124-222","4321:objective:1-15","4321:objective:17-35"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4321:completion:1-12","4321:completion:14-35","4321:completion:37-81","4321:completion:83-141","4321:completion:146-218"},["opening"]="The pylon information had given J.D. enough to begin calculations. She asked for a brief pause before another conversation could supply the answer she hoped to find.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with J.D. after her calculations.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the follow-up conversation with J.D. Collie.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="19d7efbbb1b4c1305a01664a3ae3a265dda4ce95e04be8390cadc1ad6209831a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
