[4488]={["atomIDs"]={"4488:description:1-55","4488:description:57-70","4488:description:75-136","4488:description:138-248","4488:description:250-321","4488:description:326-387","4488:description:389-457","4488:description:459-488","4488:objective:1-35"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Speak with Strahad Farsan at his tower above Ratchet.",["opening"]="Growing power had brought another warning about corruption and the limits of an untrained will. Strahad wished to speak from his tower above Ratchet, making the journey a step toward further instruction.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Strahad at Ratchet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Strahad Farsan after the summons.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="50224a88c6a5f5742a3f88d3cd3704ecededf2390be49d8f737beb315b784d34",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4489]={["aftermath"]="Strahad greeted the return with a barbed observation about the lure of power.",["atomIDs"]={"4489:description:1-8","4489:description:10-19","4489:description:24-56","4489:description:61-78","4489:description:80-157","4489:description:159-224","4489:description:229-246","4489:description:248-322","4489:description:324-352","4489:description:354-374","4489:objective:1-35"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4489:completion:1-46","4489:completion:48-63","4489:completion:68-110","4489:completion:112-142","4489:completion:144-210"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Visit Strahad Farsan in the Barrens.",["opening"]="Recognition of increasing power brought a summons from Ratchet. Strahad wished to reward the work already done, and delay was discouraged.",["pending"]="{actor} would travel to Strahad's tower.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Strahad Farsan.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="5819fbf5917d88cba265a3e053006948dd8b36a075d8a659eceb2830759c25df",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4490]={["aftermath"]="Strahad offered his farewell and anticipated another meeting.",["atomIDs"]={"4490:description:1-58","4490:description:60-149","4490:description:151-177","4490:description:179-202","4490:description:207-285","4490:objective:1-77"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4490:completion:1-14","4490:completion:16-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Receive Strahad's instruction in summoning a felsteed.",["opening"]="Strahad offered the summoning knowledge as recognition of patience and hard work. His warning looked ahead: such power would one day demand a much harder trial than the gift he now offered.",["pending"]="{actor} would receive Strahad's teaching.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the instruction offered by Strahad.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="59216d2ebd9f6384702cfdad423b4de1b630d99d1eb8a1ca4bb884189c0ce0ce",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4491]={["aftermath"]="Spraggle was glad Ringo had returned alive, though she said he remained in poor shape. The rescue ended his isolation without inventing a complete recovery.",["atomIDs"]={"4491:description:1-6","4491:description:8-21","4491:description:26-106","4491:description:108-148","4491:description:153-219","4491:description:221-264","4491:description:269-388","4491:description:390-416","4491:objective:1-49","4491:objective:54-107"},["bridge"]="The search had found Ringo overcome by the volcano's heat. Spraggle's canteen could help if he fainted during the escort back to the Refuge.",["bridgeFrom"]=4492,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4491:completion:1-79","4491:completion:84-109"},["opening"]="Ringo believed heat exhaustion had stopped his volcano exploration. He could follow a guide to Spraggle at the Refuge, hoping her canteen would revive him if the heat overcame him again.",["pending"]="{actor} would lead Ringo to Spraggle, using the canteen if he fainted.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Ringo's escort to Spraggle Frock.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b3521eda61fb7668cd9beb0d629a7d97a718a48563ea6c9abf1d5f26ee00cafb",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4492]={["atomIDs"]={"4492:description:1-26","4492:description:28-136","4492:description:138-167","4492:description:172-203","4492:description:205-291","4492:objective:1-31"},["opening"]="Ringo had stayed away too long after leaving to explore the southern volcano. Spraggle sent a canteen with the search, certain her missing friend would need water if he were found.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Ringo at Fire Plume Ridge.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Ringo at Fire Plume Ridge.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b3e570c128cf7cb1b8906f49619bd0c11fc227b51ccbe711147674aedb4dc0f6",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4493]={["atomIDs"]={"4493:description:1-133","4493:description:136-233","4493:description:238-285","4493:description:288-363","4493:description:366-437","4493:description:440-509","4493:objective:1-43"},["opening"]="Gracina believed the silithid consumed every ecology unlike their own. She suspected their strength originated deeper west in Un'Goro and sent that theory to Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan for a practical response.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to explain Gracina's theory to Pestlezugg.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f53d7f4ea7f30d800d66a033cffaea7329ca191a902f7604ad90a9c78c98b291",["sourceRaceMask"]="1101",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4494]={["aftermath"]="The alchemist treated the proposed origin as possible rather than proven.",["atomIDs"]={"4494:description:1-133","4494:description:136-233","4494:description:238-285","4494:description:288-363","4494:description:366-437","4494:description:440-509","4494:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4494:completion:1-45","4494:completion:47-164","4494:completion:166-220","4494:completion:222-235","4494:completion:237-301","4494:completion:303-385"},["opening"]="Zilzibin interpreted the insects as a threat to all other life and suspected a stronger center in Un'Goro. Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan was to receive the theory and assist further research.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to relay the suspected crater connection.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} consulted Pestlezugg.",["sourceHash"]="47327ecd80c686805b921cd94ccd7cd98b6148e9dc1a5ea8fc2da2edcbff011d",["sourceRaceMask"]="690",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4495]={["atomIDs"]={"4495:description:1-76","4495:description:78-170","4495:description:175-209","4495:description:211-341","4495:description:346-422","4495:objective:1-38"},["opening"]="Iverron had missed his usual visit by several hours. Dirania knew he frequented the northern cave and worried about the spiders there, asking that a traveler watch for her friend.",["pending"]="{actor} would look for Iverron near the northern cave.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Iverron by the cave north of Shadowglen.",["sourceHash"]="8223f442e23a027d7076df293a2591f6689ccdf79d80490b4da813910a2ca311",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4496]={["aftermath"]="Pestlezugg accepted the intact gland and soil for a lure. He still needed to brew it before attempting to draw out the queen.",["atomIDs"]={"4496:description:1-138","4496:description:141-232","4496:description:237-327","4496:description:330-427","4496:description:430-484","4496:objective:1-92"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4496:completion:1-24","4496:completion:26-65","4496:completion:67-112","4496:completion:114-200","4496:completion:205-242","4496:completion:244-366","4496:completion:368-392"},["opening"]="Pestlezugg compared the silithid to bees and hoped a queen's death would disorganize a hive. A scent gland and soil from Un'Goro were needed to brew the lure before that theory could be tried.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring a Gorishi Scent Gland and five Un'Goro Soil samples to Pestlezugg.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Gorishi Scent Gland and five Un'Goro Soil samples to Pestlezugg.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="30a0661faef4b6a3bfef502ff8361935daba6fb159b6127a234997a8999d0a44",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4501]={["atomIDs"]={"4501:description:1-100","4501:description:102-184","4501:description:189-264","4501:description:269-333","4501:objective:1-96"},["opening"]="A notice called for action against the crater's growing Pterrordax population. Travelers faced an increasing danger from ordinary and frenzied creatures, with Spraggle named to receive the report.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront ten Pterrordax and fifteen Frenzied Pterrordax.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the specified Pterrordax assignment and spoke with Spraggle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="96efe227aeae63b681cd8f108fce479be7d616dc1ce9c5750f9e156a47bae1ba",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4502]={["aftermath"]="Liv accepted the ash for her studies and promised to share findings later. The sample delivery did not yet settle the cause of the volcanic activity.",["atomIDs"]={"4502:description:1-64","4502:description:66-169","4502:description:174-304","4502:description:306-398","4502:description:403-476","4502:objective:1-140"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4502:completion:1-45","4502:completion:47-60","4502:completion:62-126"},["opening"]="Marvon's long absence encouraged Liv to pursue experiments independently. Ash from the volcano's fire elementals could help her study the crater's unusual volcanic activity.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect nine Un'Goro Ash samples for Liv.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered nine samples of Un'Goro Ash to Liv Rizzlefix.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="5e96145910ec15ad68dd35e51aae158f031acb9b791356a644c5e87376c316a1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4503]={["aftermath"]="Shizzle judged the scales suitable for getting his flyer airborne. His confidence was a prediction, not an observed first flight.",["atomIDs"]={"4503:description:1-28","4503:description:33-106","4503:description:108-199","4503:description:204-224","4503:description:226-358","4503:description:360-441","4503:description:443-470","4503:objective:1-99"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4503:completion:1-30","4503:completion:32-108","4503:completion:113-119"},["opening"]="Stranded Shizzle feared the beasts that carried other travelers out of the crater. A flying machine of his own still needed wings, and the webbed scales of two local creatures seemed suited to them.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather eight Webbed Diemetradon Scales and eight Webbed Pterrordax Scales.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered eight Webbed Diemetradon Scales and eight Webbed Pterrordax Scales to Shizzle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1bd87a5105940bf168390ce5ecf154cc46cf59280d7a762c62ac785d4783aa91",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4504]={["atomIDs"]={"4504:description:1-54","4504:description:56-133","4504:description:135-161","4504:description:166-178","4504:description:183-255","4504:description:257-347","4504:description:349-392","4504:description:397-498","4504:objective:1-65"},["opening"]="Tran'rek saw profit in a stronger adhesive from Un'Goro's northern tar pits. He believed the tar creatures' chlorophyll made their coating stickier than ordinary tar and wanted twelve samples.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect twelve Super Sticky Tar samples for Tran'rek.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twelve samples of Super Sticky Tar to Tran'rek.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2c7e86de25e1fed0ab5caa83158ce2502627826738ca8bfda459768b14250c5e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4505]={["atomIDs"]={"4505:description:1-45","4505:description:47-161","4505:description:166-271","4505:description:273-399","4505:description:404-460","4505:description:462-494","4505:objective:1-120"},["opening"]="Winna wanted advantage from a moonwell the satyrs had corrupted. Its former purpose of renewal had turned toward creating more of them, but she sought a water sample for her kitten experiment.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Winna a corrupted sample.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered water from the moonwell.",["sourceHash"]="1a41002a00b0a94ff8d34b61d663d6c87df398bf92847d2ef7eba4dd86e38657",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4506]={["aftermath"]="Winna anticipated military value from the corrupted water.",["atomIDs"]={"4506:description:1-54","4506:description:56-148","4506:description:150-157","4506:description:159-188","4506:description:193-201","4506:description:203-303","4506:description:305-315","4506:description:317-360","4506:description:365-429","4506:objective:1-87","4506:objective:92-164"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4506:completion:1-10","4506:completion:15-84","4506:completion:86-165"},["opening"]="A small dose had already made Winna's kitten larger and apparently stronger. She sent another cat into the moonwell's influence to test whether that change could serve future conflict.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to expose the kitten and bring it back.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the changed cat to Winna.",["sourceHash"]="f29886f39fa7118496ebd7187cd5ae48e8cf4344a9d21f56b997c113a3304e6b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4507]={["aftermath"]="Pestlezugg celebrated the queen's defeat but doubted the silithid presence ended with her. Understanding the recovered brain would take time, and a neat final victory seemed implausible to him.",["atomIDs"]={"4507:description:1-16","4507:description:19-75","4507:description:78-159","4507:description:162-240","4507:description:245-367","4507:description:370-409","4507:description:412-467","4507:description:470-483","4507:objective:1-51","4507:objective:56-124"},["bridge"]="The scent gland and soil had reached Pestlezugg, and the lure was ready. A crystal within the Gorishi hatcheries might draw out the guarded queen whose brain he needed.",["bridgeFrom"]=4496,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4507:completion:1-14","4507:completion:17-55","4507:completion:58-186","4507:completion:191-277","4507:completion:280-336"},["opening"]="The lure was ready for a crystal thought to attune the Gorishi hive. Pestlezugg suggested the hatcheries as its likely site and warned of guards around the queen whose brain he needed for study.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon the Gorishi Hive Queen and bring her brain to Pestlezugg.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Gorishi Hive Queen assignment and delivered the Gorishi Queen's Brain to Pestlezugg.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b2b44b0ac32fdad6f5ddccaefa846b946c17b45d1aa96002a4bcd086054e8fc4",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4508]={["aftermath"]="Gracina feared the Alliance would ignore a danger beyond the Horde. She disputed Staghelm's interpretation and urged continued commitment despite disagreement within Darnassus.",["atomIDs"]={"4508:description:1-129","4508:description:132-198","4508:description:203-316","4508:description:319-447","4508:objective:1-70"},["bridge"]="The queen assignment had returned to Pestlezugg without settling his concerns about the larger infestation. His latest Un'Goro report was bound for Gracina and the Alliance contacts Gadgetzan needed.",["bridgeFrom"]=4507,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4508:completion:1-73","4508:completion:76-229","4508:completion:232-355","4508:completion:358-406","4508:completion:411-448","4508:completion:451-501"},["opening"]="Gadgetzan's findings now required resources beyond its own reach. Pestlezugg sent the Un'Goro report to Gracina, hoping her connections could bring the Alliance's leaders into the struggle.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Gracina.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Gracina Spiritmight.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="6455b90dde44e3045dcaccc1aeac8e2d020c73c4556ec44b783e4cf7a2888d13",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4509]={["aftermath"]="Zilzibin doubted the Horde would heed a danger unrelated to the Alliance. He thought Thrall might act if informed, but conflicting advisers could obstruct that response.",["atomIDs"]={"4509:description:1-129","4509:description:132-198","4509:description:203-329","4509:description:332-464","4509:objective:1-68"},["bridge"]="Pestlezugg had the queen's brain but doubted the danger was finished. He sent his latest Un'Goro findings to Zilzibin in hope that Horde support could follow.",["bridgeFrom"]=4507,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4509:completion:1-73","4509:completion:76-141","4509:completion:144-262","4509:completion:265-376","4509:completion:381-418","4509:completion:421-471"},["opening"]="Pestlezugg wanted the latest findings to reach the Horde through Zilzibin. Gadgetzan could not face the developing threat alone, and the scholar's contacts might turn research into wider aid.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Zilzibin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Zilzibin Drumlore.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="368fa98689ac73961a497bfd780812372ea852a643f11223ae570f9a45c8cd5d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4510]={["atomIDs"]={"4510:description:1-36","4510:description:39-133","4510:description:136-268","4510:description:270-324","4510:description:329-366","4510:description:369-457","4510:description:460-499","4510:objective:1-59"},["opening"]="The Un'Goro findings had made Gracina doubt her proposed origin for the silithid. A stronger presence might lie elsewhere; while she absorbed that uncertainty, a bank voucher marked her thanks for the research.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the Bank Voucher to Idriana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Bank Voucher to Idriana in Darnassus.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b672e69d0b93e748097169d8e781a3a039f9562267c80ffffd4008215d745d73",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4511]={["aftermath"]="Karus confirmed authority to release an item from Zilzibin's account.",["atomIDs"]={"4511:description:1-50","4511:description:53-146","4511:description:149-281","4511:description:283-337","4511:description:342-377","4511:description:380-467","4511:description:470-510","4511:objective:1-57"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4511:completion:1-115","4511:completion:118-159"},["opening"]="The crater findings had made Zilzibin doubt his original theory. A stronger presence might lie elsewhere, and the next work required thought before another expedition.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to redeem Zilzibin's bank voucher.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented it to Karus.",["sourceHash"]="f42fd8cdada937f34d4afa0da1812daa5192fb3bacf7c5d74dfc384f76442226",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4512]={["aftermath"]="Laris welcomed the samples and prepared tests he hoped would establish his scientific standing. His ambitions did not supply the research results ahead of time.",["atomIDs"]={"4512:description:1-40","4512:description:42-84","4512:description:89-169","4512:description:171-267","4512:description:269-287","4512:description:289-312","4512:description:317-346","4512:description:348-419","4512:description:421-507","4512:objective:1-96"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4512:completion:1-20","4512:completion:22-122","4512:completion:124-133","4512:completion:135-168","4512:completion:170-207","4512:completion:212-286","4512:completion:291-413"},["opening"]="Laris wanted to understand ooze and the apothecaries' interest in collecting it. His jars were intended for Felwood's cursed and tainted creatures, whose samples could extend his research.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather six Filled Cursed Ooze Jars and six Filled Tainted Ooze Jars.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered six Filled Cursed Ooze Jars and six Filled Tainted Ooze Jars to Laris.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8fe5ac1520d21840a21c2cbcabe283df03293817d0589dc9444f88d2144b7811",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4513]={["aftermath"]="The pure samples gave Laris further work. His thanks left future findings and requests open rather than stating a final explanation of ooze.",["atomIDs"]={"4513:description:1-35","4513:description:37-104","4513:description:106-120","4513:description:122-166","4513:description:168-202","4513:description:204-221","4513:description:223-270","4513:description:272-297","4513:description:299-344","4513:description:346-398","4513:description:400-409","4513:description:411-417","4513:description:422-425","4513:description:427-490","4513:objective:1-66","4513:objective:71-145"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4513:completion:1-16","4513:completion:18-54","4513:completion:56-142","4513:completion:147-182","4513:completion:184-293","4513:completion:298-307","4513:completion:309-326"},["opening"]="Laris thought ooze adapted to its surroundings, making Felwood's samples corrupt like the land itself. He wanted ten purer specimens but could not yet define purity or give a certain source.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek ten Filled Pure Sample Jars for Laris.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Filled Pure Sample Jars to Laris Geardawdle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2f73ea05a5c7d8530e8ac8ec94511b6eed45ff4c94770122410bd835c8c19806",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
